---
import { url, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../config';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Check your inbox" description="Thanks for subscribing to Unlock the Week. Confirm your email to start receiving it." noindex>
  <div class="narrow page-head" style="text-align:center">
    <span class="kicker">Unlock the Week</span>
    <h1>Almost there. Check your inbox.</h1>
    <p>Thanks for subscribing. We just sent a confirmation email. Open it and click <strong>Confirm my subscription</strong> to start getting Unlock the Week.</p>
    <div class="panel" style="text-align:left;margin-top:1.5rem">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:0">Don't see it?</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Give it a minute or two, then check your Spam or Promotions folder.</li>
        <li>Make sure the address you entered was spelled correctly. If not, just <a href={url('/newsletter/')}>sign up again</a>.</li>
        <li>Still nothing? Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> and we'll sort it out.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="btn btn-primary" href={url('/')} data-umami-event="nl-thanks-home">Back to NeonKey</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
